        "original_id": "6ce245f1-4386-54f3-9db0-1d5399847498",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joseph Morgan, Gonzalo López-Gallego, Sharlto Copley, Thomas Kretschmann, Erin Richards, Josie Ho\n- Roles: Klaus Mikaelson, Jonah Cooke\n- Products: The Vampire Diaries, The Originals, Open Grave\n- Concepts: Original vampires\n\nFacts:\n- Joseph Morgan was born as Joseph Martin on 16 May 1981 and is an English actor and director.\n- Joseph Morgan is best known for playing Klaus Mikaelson in The CW series The Vampire Diaries and its spin-off The Originals.\n- In the universes of The Vampire Diaries and The Originals, the Original vampires are a vampire family from which all current vampires descend and are the most powerful and indestructible vampires.\n- Open Grave is a 2013 post-apocalyptic zombie-like suspense film directed by Gonzalo López-Gallego.\n- In Open Grave, Sharlto Copley stars as Jonah Cooke, and Thomas Kretschmann, Joseph Morgan, Erin Richards, and Josie Ho appear in supporting roles.",
